dialect protocol
protocol playground.mutations
version 1
schema demonstrator.playground.mutations
start record
framing record

# Real op frame: `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`) then `tag u8`, then the kind's own payload (its leaf's `💾️binary` codec).
# Each record is one mutation kind at its wire tag. This file is the only source of those tags: every leaf
# codec derives its tag from its record at compile time (`dsl::protocol_record::tag_u32`).
header fixed 2
field format u8
field tag u8
record change-schema tag=0
field payload bytes
